  "question": {
    "text": "If the length of the minor axis of ellipse is equal to half of the distance between the foci, then the eccentricity of the ellipse is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "qpWxo",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Szbbk",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "oyiHB",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "w2A7H",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The length of minor axis is given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and the distance between foci is given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p>",
    "image": null
